# ── 仓库只放 Minecraft 启动器本身与它的发布工具 ──
# 私人文件（会话导出、网关探测、蓝图、截图、AGENTS 等）一律不入库，本地磁盘保留。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/mc-launcher/
!/mc-launcher/**
!/.github/
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/release.yml
!/scripts/
/scripts/*
!/scripts/make-update-manifest.ps1
!/scripts/README-release.md

# ── 启动器目录里的构建产物与临时文件也不入库 ──
mc-launcher/**/bin/
mc-launcher/**/obj/
mc-launcher/dist/
mc-launcher/scratch/
mc-launcher/.probe-cache/
mc-launcher/*.log
mc-launcher/**/*.log
mc-launcher/*.args.txt